# Project context

Before changing architecture, APIs, multiplatform behavior, or screen flows, read:

- `docs/PROJECT_CONTEXT.md` (hub)
- Then the relevant doc: `docs/architecture.md`, `docs/endpoints.md`, `docs/platforms.md`, `docs/features-map.md`

Procedural checklists:

- New/changed HTTP endpoint → `docs/skills/add-endpoint/SKILL.md` and update `docs/endpoints.md`
- New/changed screen flow → `docs/skills/view-flow/SKILL.md` and update `docs/features-map.md`

Setup/env (FVM, Windows toolchain) stays in root `README.md`. Do not duplicate inventories in this rule.
